Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:04.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Diwali's over? No, the gods' Diwali is tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:07.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kartik Purnima, Tuesday, 24 November.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:11.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Purnima tithi begins late on Monday night,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.33,0:00:14.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the lamps are lit on Tuesday evening, in pradosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.65,0:00:19.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many families take an early dip in a river,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.13,0:00:23.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,light diyas at dusk and worship Shiva and Vishnu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:28.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,In Somnath, the Kartik Purnima fair is held by the sea:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:30.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,darshan, folk programmes and stalls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.95,0:00:35.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,At Vautha near Dholka, people bathe at the sangam,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:39.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the fair is known for its donkey and camel market.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.25,0:00:44.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,In Shamlaji, people bathe in the Meshwo before darshan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:47.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bhil devotees call the deity Kaliyo Dev.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.30,0:00:52.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Screenshot this slide: the date, the lamp time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.09,0:00:54.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,and three fairs, all in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:00:59.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which fair have you been to? Tell us in the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:02.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stories of Gujarat, on the otlo. Follow Otlo.
